Oops, what I meant to say was that for point transects, you need to multiply the integral by 2*pi and then divide by the area. Following the example on the distsamp help page, this will give you p. I'll try to add a user-friendly function.

integrate(grhn, 0, 25, sigma=exp(2.28))$value * 2*pi / (pi*25^2)

